### Current problem

The 3D dual-video analysis interface does not clearly distinguish the configuration of Camera 1 from Camera 2.

Since the cameras may have different frame rates, clip durations, starting frames, frame counts, and playback configurations, they must not share ambiguous clip settings.

### Required implementation

